# Bundled binaries (redis-server, yt-dlp, MaxMind DBs, guess, login-bg.mp4) are
# stored as regular Git objects — NOT Git LFS. ffmpeg/ffprobe are not bundled:
# every node fetches its distribution's builds from XC_VM_FFMPEG (`ffmpeg`).
#
# The former `filter=lfs` tracking rules were removed to stop consuming the
# repository's Git LFS budget: plain-git clone bandwidth is not metered. These
# are binary files — mark them so Git never tries to line-diff or merge them.
src/bin/maxmind/GeoIP2-ISP.mmdb                -text -diff
src/bin/maxmind/cidr.db                        -text -diff
src/bin/redis/redis-server                     -text -diff
src/bin/guess                                  -text -diff
src/bin/yt-dlp                                 -text -diff
src/Public/assets/admin/videos/login-bg.mp4    -text -diff
